"In stage [{stage_name}], the variable [{key}] is used as a path variable in "
"some resources, and must exist."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:91
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"环境【{stage_name}】中，环境变量【{key}】在发布版本的资源配置中被用作路径变"
"量，变量值不是一个合法的 URL 路径片段。"
