#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"环境【{stage_name}】中，环境变量【{key}】在发布版本的资源配置中被用作 Host 变"
"量，不能为空。"
msgstr ""
"In stage [{stage_name}], the variable [{key}] is used as a Host variable in "
"some resources, and cannot be empty."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:113
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"环境【{stage_name}】中，环境变量【{key}】在发布版本的资源配置中被用作 Host 变"
"量，变量值不是一个合法的 Host（不包含\"http(s)://\"）。"
msgstr ""
"In stage [{stage_name}], the variable [{key}] is used as a Host variable in "
"some resources, but it's value is not a valid Host (not including "
"\"http(s)://\")."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"网关环境【{stage_name}】中的配置【后端服务 {backend_name} 地址】不合法。请在"
"网关 `后端服务` 中进行配置。"
msgstr ""
"The backend service [{backend_name}] config Hosts of stage [{stage_name}] is "
"invalid, please configure it in the `Backend Service`."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:175
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"网关环境【{stage_name}】缺少后端服务【{backends}】的配置，请在网关 `后端服务"
"` 中进行配置。"
msgstr ""
"Gateway stage [{stage_name}] is missing the configuration for backend "
"service [{backends}]. Please configure it in the gateway `Backend Service`."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:188
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"网关环境【{stage_name}】中的模型后端服务【{backend_name}】配置解密失败，不允"
"许发布。"
msgstr ""
"Failed to decrypt the configuration of model service [{backend_name}] in "
"gateway stage [{stage_name}]. Publishing is not allowed."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:200
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"网关环境【{stage_name}】中的模型后端服务【{backend_name}】配置结构不合法，不"
"允许发布。"
msgstr ""
"The configuration structure of model service [{backend_name}] in gateway "
"stage [{stage_name}] is invalid. Publishing is not allowed."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:227
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"网关环境【{stage_name}】存在插件配置或插件类型为空的插件绑定，不允许发布。"
msgstr ""
"Gateway stage [{stage_name}] has plugin bindings with an empty plugin "
"configuration or plugin type. Publishing is not allowed."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:235
#, python-brace-format
msgid "网关环境【{stage_name}】存在绑定多个相同类型[{plugin_code}]的插件。"
msgstr ""
"Multiple plugins of the same type [{plugin_code}] are bound in the gateway "
"environment [{stage_name}]."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:256
#, python-brace-format
