"版本【{resource_version}】数据结构已经不兼容，不允许发布，请在【资源配置】中"
"新建版本再发布"
msgstr ""
"The data structure of version [{resource_version}] is incompatible and "
"cannot be published. Please create a new version in [Resource Configuration] "
"and publish again."

#: apigateway/service/release/validation.py:264
#, python-brace-format
msgid "网关【{gateway_name}】没有启用，不允许发布"
msgstr "Gateway [{gateway_name}] is not enabled, publishing is not allowed."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:26
msgid "认证未通过，请检查所填账号、密码或访问令牌是否正确、有效。"
msgstr ""
"Authentication failed. Check that the account, password, or access token you "
"entered is correct and valid."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:27
msgid "访问被拒绝，请检查仓库权限及 Git 服务访问限制。"
msgstr ""
"Access was denied. Check repository permissions and Git service access "
"restrictions."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:28
msgid "仓库不存在或当前账号无权访问，请检查仓库地址和权限。"
msgstr ""
"The repository does not exist or is inaccessible to this account. Check the "
"repository URL and permissions."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:29
msgid "Git 服务请求受限，请稍后重试。"
msgstr "The Git service is rate limiting requests. Try again later."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:57
msgid "无法连接 Git 服务，请检查仓库地址和网络连接，或稍后重试。"
msgstr ""
"Unable to connect to the Git service. Check the repository URL and network "
"connection, or try again later."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:59
msgid "请求 Git 服务失败，请检查仓库地址和服务状态。"
msgstr "The Git request failed. Check the repository URL and service status."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:67
msgid "响应不是 Git Smart HTTP 格式，请检查仓库地址。"
msgstr ""
"The response is not in Git Smart HTTP format. Check the repository URL."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:69
msgid "Git 服务返回异常，请稍后重试或联系 Git 服务管理员。"
msgstr ""
"The Git service returned an error. Try again later or contact its "
"administrator."

#: apigateway/utils/git.py:71
msgid "Git 服务重定向异常，请检查仓库地址或联系 Git 服务管理员。"
msgstr ""
"The Git service returned an invalid redirect or too many redirects. Check "
"the repository URL or contact its administrator."

